		(at 141.8393 93.196 29.43)
		(descr "JNJ-L-3535EW120-85035D-SL-J2 (LCSC C22447930), 850 nm 120 deg IR emitter. Land pattern from vendor recommended pad drawing, datasheet rev A p.3. The datasheet pad view is a BOTTOM view (pin 1 left), so this top-view footprint is mirrored: pin 1 on the right. Pad 1 = cathode, pads 2 = anode (package pins 2+3 are internally common; centre is the anode/thermal pad). Thermal vias added in the anode pad - NOT in the vendor drawing.")
